      "label": "woman_pointing_to_sky_with_divine_message",
      "description": "A woman wearing a light blue hijab and a gray sweater is depicted looking upward with her right index finger pointed toward the sky, conveying reverence or acknowledgment of a higher power. The text 'allah is watching you' is overlaid on the image, visually mapping the message onto her gesture to imply divine surveillance. The scene composition places the woman as the central participant, with her upward gaze and finger pointing symbolically directing attention to the divine.",
