      "description": "The text 'allah is watching you' is mapped onto the visual of the woman pointing upward, symbolizing divine surveillance. Her gesture and upward gaze are interpreted as a visual representation of the textual message, creating an analogical mapping where the woman's action embodies the concept of Allah observing.",
