      "description": "The central visual subject is a woman wearing a hijab, which is a headscarf commonly worn by Muslim women. Her gesture and the text 'allah is watching you' directly reference Islamic theology and divine surveillance, indicating the meme is designed for or at least references a Muslim audience. The hijab is a key cultural and religious marker identifying her as part of the Muslim community.",
